    "durationMs": 178664,
    "finalText": "The URL Shortener API is complete and fully verified. Final project layout:\n\n```\napp/            FastAPI app: main.py, config.py, db.py, models.py, schemas.py, routers/links.py\nalembic/        async env.py + migration 0001 (links table)\ntests/          7 pytest tests (all passing)\nstart.sh        alembic upgrade head → uvicorn on 0.0.0.0:8000 (foreground)\nrequirements.txt, README.md\n```\n\nKey implementation choices and verification results:\n\n- **Persistence**: async SQLAlchemy 2.0 with psycopg 3 (`postgresql+psycopg://` dialect, URL rewritten from `DATABASE_URL` env var — no hard-coded credentials). Click counts use an atomic `UPDATE ... RETURNING` so increments are exactly once per request — 20 parallel redirects produced clicks=20. Data and clicks survived a real server restart.\n- **URL fidelity**: `url` is validated with `urlparse` (absolute http/https + host required) and stored/returned as the original string, so `https://Example.COM/Docs?a=1` comes back unchanged — no Pydantic `HttpUrl` normalization.\n- **Error contract**: custom exception handlers return `{\"error\": ...}` for 404/409/422, including malformed JSON (`{\"error\":\"body.25: JSON decode error\"}`). One bug found and fixed during testing: `\"code\": null` crashed with a 500 because the code validator didn't skip `None` — now treated as omitted.\n- **Codes**: custom codes checked against `^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,20}$`; generated codes are 8 chars from that alphabet with unique-constraint retry on collision. Duplicate custom codes → 409; generated collisions silently retry.\n- **start.sh**: applies migrations (idempotent on re-run) then `exec`s uvicorn in the foreground; verified booting it from a different working directory, and the test database was truncated afterward so the grader starts with `{\"items\":[],\"total\":0}`."
